  ('be508a50-37b3-5c24-964a-4d2967278972', '845dbdcc-23fc-5cb9-94b1-72770f2bbd16', 'Army', 'enlisted', '42S', null, 'development', 'E-9', null, 'Sergeant Major/Command Sergeant Major — recommended career management (applies to every MOS in this career management field)', 'Chapter 3. Recommended Career Management and Self-Development, By Rank', '(1) SGMs/CSMs possess a broad understanding of strategic and organizational behavior in order to advise commanders in operations and enlisted matters.
