  ('3b7e7eed-3177-553f-9454-572a4d65817f', '845dbdcc-23fc-5cb9-94b1-72770f2bbd16', 'Army', 'enlisted', '42R', null, 'self_development', 'E-8', null, 'Master Sergeant and First Sergeant — Self-Development', 'Chapter 7. Military occupational specialty 42R musician', '(1) Competitive Boards. Expert Soldier Badge, Army Bands Soldier/NCO of the Year, participation in Soldier/NCO Competition Boards, participation in SAMC/Morales Club.
