  ('16062e68-6613-512b-a4b7-5d428d771932', '845dbdcc-23fc-5cb9-94b1-72770f2bbd16', 'Army', 'enlisted', '42R', null, 'credentials', 'E-8', null, 'Master Sergeant and First Sergeant — Credentials/Certifications', 'Chapter 7. Military occupational specialty 42R musician', 'Civilian credentialing contributes to military career development and may be accepted for self-development requirements and in performance evaluations. Some credentials are more related to the 42R - Musician MOS while Common Core Credentials are related to duties performed by any Soldier regardless of MOS. Credentials may require additional education, training, or experience. For more information about credentialing opportunities visit the ARMY COOL (Credentialing Opportunities On-Line) website. https://www.cool.osd.mil/army/index.html.', 'f8ed8baea1cecb057a6d43e0eeba395785c1170d21af5416a4f89e823af65b2f', 24, 25, null, 39, null, null, false, null),
