(1) Most qualified. A MSG that has successfully completed their key experience positions should be considered ahead of their peers for promotion. The most qualified MSG to be selected for SGM looks like:
(a) Leadership positions. 18+ months of highly rated service as a Band 1SG or USASOM 1SG. Additional successful service as a Band Operations Sergeant or in an institutional or broadening assignment should be considered favorably.
