(4) Additional skills qualification training. NCOs may be selected for ASI and SQI producing courses that are necessary for overall unit readiness and training or for specific assignments: Battalion Command Sergeant Major Pre-Command Course; Brigade Command Sergeant Major Pre-Command Course, “How the Army Runs” course, Air Assault (ASI 2B), and Airborne (SQI P).', 'cda23650e3229a2338583da51386cb91f250b775db915b2e3d7f1f114e861b66', 26, 26, null, 42, null, null, false, null),
