  ('12824680-a34c-5245-8108-99532d2d8ad1', '845dbdcc-23fc-5cb9-94b1-72770f2bbd16', 'Army', 'enlisted', '42R', null, 'self_development', 'E-9', null, 'Sergeant Major and Command Sergeant Major — Self-Development', 'Chapter 7. Military occupational specialty 42R musician', '(1) Competitive Boards. Expert Soldier Badge, Army Bands Soldier/NCO of the Year, participation in Soldier/NCO Competition Boards, participation in SAMC/Morales Club.
